# CSE Publication Workspace

System: `{{ values.system.name }}`

Release: `{{ values.release }}`

This is the cache-only publication workspace. It is not the restricted source
build handoff. `./cse-build status`, `verify`, `shell`, and the default tmux
session remain available for inspection. The command blocks `concretize`,
`fetch`, and ordinary `install` actions here. Follow the CSE runbook to copy the
